1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,373
Fourteen ships entered the

2
00:00:01,393 --> 00:00:03,514
Suez Canal for a one-day trip.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,220
They got out eight years later.

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,420
Halfway through, war broke out.

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,623
Egypt sank ships to block the canal.

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,795
Trapped in a lake, nowhere to go.

7
00:00:11,815 --> 00:00:13,744
Sandstorms dusted them yellow.

8
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:14,930
The Yellow Fleet.

9
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,460
Their countries were rivals.

10
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,130
The sailors became friends.

11
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,240
Football on deck.

12
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,275
Their own stamps.

13
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,630
Their own Olympics.

14
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:22,645
Poland won.

15
00:00:22,665 --> 00:00:23,785
Home to Hamburg.

16
00:00:23,895 --> 00:00:25,688
Tens of thousands cheered.

17
00:00:25,765 --> 00:00:26,685
Part of the cargo?

18
00:00:26,815 --> 00:00:27,622
Kitchen clocks.

19
00:00:27,745 --> 00:00:29,485
Delivered only eight years late.

20
00:00:29,755 --> 00:00:31,435
How many stars for this delivery?
